#: ../../../plus/debug-tools/whisper.rst:15
msgid "Whisper"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debug-tools/whisper.rst:17
msgid ""
"Whisper is a RISCV instruction set simulator (ISS) developed for the "
"verification of the Swerv micro-controller. It allows the user to run RISCV "
"code without RISCV hardware. It has an interactive mode where the user can "
"single step the target RISCV code and inspect/modify the RISCV registers or "
"the simulated system memory. It can also run in lock step with a Verilog "
"simulator serving as a \"golden model\" against which an implementation is "
"checked after each instruction of a test program. Official reference can be "
"found `here  <https://github.com/westerndigitalcorporation/swerv-ISS/?"
"utm_source=platformio&utm_medium=docs>`__."
msgstr ""

